In `packages/shared/src/utils/chatml/adapters/pydantic-ai.ts`, a **user** message whose parts contain both tool responses and text loses its text during normalization.

`normalizeMessage` splits user messages that carry `tool_call_response` parts into separate `role: "tool"` messages, and returns only those — any text accumulated from `text` parts of the same request is dropped:

